# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles run on Linux (install.sh through `curl | sh`,
# Dockerfiles in BuildKit): keep them LF on every checkout, including Windows
# with core.autocrlf=true, where CRLF breaks `sh` and Dockerfile continuations.
*.sh        text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
